  <item>
    <title>Vol.33 八字排盘到底用哪个时间更准？真太阳时、早晚子时、第五柱、胎命身？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6aeda9ca5b7c4709bfe219a0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aeda9ca5b7c4709bfe219a0</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 10:27:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p></p><p><span>四柱八字论命的第一步，也是最关键的一步，就是用自己出生的时间，排出属于自己的八个字。在这关键的这一步中，始终有很多不清不楚的问题。本期就来聊聊八字命理当中的一些时间概念。</span></p><p></p><p><span>祝，收听愉快。</span></p><p></p><p><span>以下是本期要点：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="117">01:57</a> </span><strong><span>真太阳时</span></strong><span>vs</span><strong><span>北京时间</span></strong><span>，到底该用哪个？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="659">10:59</a> 什么样的人需要换算</span><strong><span>夏令时</span></strong><span>？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="808">13:28</a> 神仙难断</span><strong><span>子时命</span></strong><span>，子时命怎么算？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1086">18:06</a> 不知道自己几点生的话，该如何</span><strong><span>生时矫正</span></strong><span>？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1463">24:23</a> </span><strong><span>农历公历阴历阳历</span></strong><span>都有什么区别？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1703">28:23</a> </span><strong><span>闰月的八字</span></strong><span>怎么看？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1898">31:38</a> 传说中的</span><strong><span>干支纪年法</span></strong><span>有什么特别之处？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2276">37:56</a> </span><strong><span>二十四节气</span></strong><span>对八字的影响有哪些？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2393">39:53</a> </span><strong><span>人元司令分野</span></strong><span>中的隐性贵人怎么看？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2603">43:23</a> </span><strong><span>不同</span></strong><span>软件排盘</span><strong><span>结果不一样</span></strong><span>该信哪一个？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2665">44:25</a> </span><strong><span>海外</span></strong><span>出生的八字怎么算？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2691">44:51</a> </span><strong><span>胎命身</span></strong><span>能看出什么信息？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2842">47:22</a> 最近流行的</span><strong><span>第五柱</span></strong><span>论命能看什么？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2902">48:22</a> </span><strong><span>剖腹产择吉</span></strong><span>有什么说法吗？</span></p><p></p><p><span>对我们感兴趣的伙伴，欢迎加入听友群💗</span></p><p><span>“music_psy” or</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/liIFTqHwZq53iT0gjwaJ4Cp4_eCQ.PNG"><p><span>&lt;关于本期BGM&gt;</span></p><p><span>开头：《Probably Up》/ Lawrence</span></p><p><span>结尾：《成仙》/ 王朝1982</span></p>]]></description>
