  <item>
    <title>Vol. 27 你与算命师父的信息差能有多大？｜命理师的职业日记（上）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69e1c911e2c8be3155735f09</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69e1c911e2c8be3155735f09</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 17 Apr 2026 05:50:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>&nbsp;本期没什么知识点，只是一个玄学从业者的工作心得，聊一点点内幕，主要是聊聊天。</span></p><p><span>祝，收听愉快。</span></p><p><span>以下是本期要点：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="34">00:34</a> Part1 算命行话，你能听懂多少？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="147">02:27</a> -六亲/夫妻</span><strong><span>缘浅？</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="477">07:57</a> -</span><strong><span>财富等级</span></strong><span>怎么算？小富是能赚多少？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="631">10:31</a> -</span><strong><span>宠物</span></strong><span>到底占不占</span><strong><span>子女宫</span></strong><span>？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="829">13:49</a> -卦师说的</span><strong><span>变动</span></strong><span>，一般指什么？真的会来吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> Part 2 如何打破自己与命理师之间的信息差？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1066">17:46</a>-当觉得对方</span><strong><span>算的不准</span></strong><span>时，如何及时反馈</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1357">22:37</a> -命理咨询时的</span><strong><span>询问话术</span></strong><span>，能让你获得更多信息</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2402">40:02</a> -随着现代命理师数量的增加，</span><strong><span>新式命理观</span></strong><span>正在逐渐形成</span></p><p><span>对我们感兴趣的伙伴，欢迎加入听友群💗</span></p><p><span>“music_psy” or</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/liIFTqHwZq53iT0gjwaJ4Cp4_eCQ.PNG"><p><span>&lt;关于本期BGM&gt;</span></p><p><span>开头：《Bitter Heart》/ Zee Avi</span></p><p><span>结尾：《Honey Take My Hand》/ Cody Francis</span></p>]]></description>
