  <item>
    <title>Vol. 26 聊聊《易经》｜玄学小白也能用《易经》算命？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69ce9efcb977fb2c47f7598a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69ce9efcb977fb2c47f7598a</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 02 Apr 2026 17:02:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“有天地，然后生万物。”</span></p><p><span>“吉、凶、悔、吝的判断，是一切活动的开始。”</span></p><p><span>“刚爻与柔爻是推演宇宙万物的根本。”</span></p><p><span>“世上虽有行善反而遭善凶，作恶反而获福果的情形，但是必须要坚持正常的道理，善果吉，恶果凶，才是正道。”</span></p><p><span>“这个世界唯一不变的就是变。”</span></p><p><span>以上是《易经》无数道理中，随口想到的五条。</span></p><p><span>《易经》之于玄学，之于哲学，之于文学，都有着深远的影响。它可以为任何身份，任何年龄的人，带去任何维度的启发。</span></p><p><span>本期我们将从零开始聊《易经》，希望大家听过之后，能对它略感兴趣，能入门一二，从而开启玄学世界的大门。</span></p><p><span>祝，收听愉快。</span></p><p><span>以下是本期要点：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="94">01:34</a> 南真</span><strong><span>闭关</span></strong><span>体验：这地球没了我，还真的也能转哈</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="320">05:20</a></span></strong><strong><span> 食伤</span></strong><span>人与</span><strong><span>官杀</span></strong><span>人：理解不了的“思想包袱”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> 为什么说，玄学各个技法入门前，都最好先看《易经》？</span></p><p><span>-晴天的恒卦启示：</span><strong><span>相克</span></strong><span>的八字，反而是</span><strong><span>良缘</span></strong><span>？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1126">18:46</a> 《易经》</span><strong><span>译本</span></strong><span>怎么选？</span></p><p><span>-一枚铜钱，就可用八卦定位</span><strong><span>失物</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1538">25:38</a> 《</span><strong><span>周易</span></strong><span>》与《</span><strong><span>易经</span></strong><span>》的区别</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1745">29:05</a></span></strong><strong><span> 先天</span></strong><span>八卦与</span><strong><span>后天</span></strong><span>八卦的区别</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1875">31:15</a> “太极生两仪，两仪生四象，四象生八卦”——南真的理科脑解答版</span></p><p><span>-阴阳符号与阴繁阳简</span></p><p><span>-太阴少阳与少阴太阳</span></p><p><span>-三爻八卦与三生万物</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2705">45:05</a></span></strong><strong><span> 丙午年值年卦</span></strong><span>“天火同人”全解析</span></p><p><span>-同人卦六爻：从初入社会到掌握主动权的完整过程</span></p><p><span>-</span><strong><span>解卦</span></strong><span>相关：同一卦象，问婚姻、问事业、问寻物，解法完全不同</span></p><p><span>对我们感兴趣的伙伴，欢迎加入听友群💗</span></p><p><span>“music_psy” or</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/liIFTqHwZq53iT0gjwaJ4Cp4_eCQ.PNG"><p><span>&lt;关于本期BGM&gt;</span></p><p><span>开头：《妙法莲华经》/ 贊詩</span></p><p><span>结尾：《赤子无愁声》/ 南青乐队</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/675d65c0af6be0d821c4c354/lnRbf3EgpCWlXyrPhNWj5SjODhRe.m4a" length="75799510" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:18:06</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/luDjfbQ9H8EmTOcfqjlM7tKmTPh-.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol. 25 丙午2026年运（下）：太岁事宜与九宫飞星风水布局｜周年特辑</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6984bc1970aae7e967c8df1f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6984bc1970aae7e967c8df1f</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 05 Feb 2026 15:57:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《神枢经》记载：“太岁，人君之象，率领诸神，统正方位，翰运时序，总成岁功。”《渊海子平》亦有记载：“太岁，乃年中之天子，故不可犯，犯之则凶。”</span></p><p><span>可见，太岁在这一年中的地位，犹如天子，掌管吉凶，不可以冒犯。&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>在做这一期节目之前，就有很多听友来咨询太岁的相关事宜，怕新的一年，会不顺，会倒霉，会破财，会发生意外。 &nbsp;</span></p><p><span>风浪越大鱼越贵，不要怕坎坷，阴阳有度，四时有序，风水一定轮流转。太岁而已，都别慌！</span></p><p><span>本期我们就来聊聊丙午年太岁相关常识，以及九宫飞星风水如何布局。</span></p><p><span>祝，收听愉快。</span></p><p><span>以下是本期要点：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="42">0:42</a> 周年特辑送</span><strong><span>福利</span></strong><span>啦&nbsp;</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="258">4:18</a> 今年</span><strong><span>谁</span></strong><span>犯太岁？</span><strong><span>犯太岁</span></strong><span>具体有什么</span><strong><span>体现？</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="347">5:47</a> -</span><strong><span>马</span></strong><span>：刑太岁/值太岁</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="508">8:28</a> -</span><strong><span>兔</span></strong><span>：破太岁</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="727">12:07</a> -</span><strong><span>牛</span></strong><span>：害太岁</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="866">14:26</a> -</span><strong><span>鼠</span></strong><span>：冲太岁</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1044">17:24</a> </span><strong><span>属鸡</span></strong><span>的丙午年需要</span><strong><span>化太岁</span></strong><span>吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1100">18:20</a> 化太岁需要</span><strong><span>什么时候</span></strong><span>化，去哪儿化，找谁化？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1480">24:40</a> 在海外附近无寺庙或时间</span><strong><span>不方便</span></strong><span>化太岁的话，家人可以</span><strong><span>代替</span></strong><span>吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1538">25:38</a>寺庙化太岁的流程与注意事项</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1632">27:12</a> </span><strong><span>谢太岁</span></strong><span>是什么？必须去吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1727">28:47</a> 今年</span><strong><span>不犯太岁</span></strong><span>的人会受到哪些岁星的影响</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2013">33:33</a> 丙午年，</span><strong><span>九宫飞星</span></strong><span>居家风水布局</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2216">36:56</a>-</span><strong><span>吉位</span></strong><span>的风水布局：方位、旺运摆件、风水禁忌</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2618">43:38</a> -</span><strong><span>凶位</span></strong><span>的风水布局：方位、注意事项、化解摆件</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2861">47:41</a> 九宫飞星风水方位的生效时间</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2916">48:36</a> 躲春tips</span></p><p><span>对我们感兴趣的伙伴，欢迎加入听友群💗</span></p><p><span>加微信“music_psy”或者扫码进群</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/liIFTqHwZq53iT0gjwaJ4Cp4_eCQ.PNG"><p><span>&lt;相关单集&gt;</span></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6979144f3cf2b0c01cee305b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6979144f3cf2b0c01cee305b"><span>Vol. 24 周年特辑（上） ｜丙午年运：赤马红羊不一定是劫！</span></a></p><p><span>&lt;关于本期BGM&gt;</span></p><p><span>开头：《Free Bird》/ Lynyrd Skynyrd</span></p><p><span>结尾：《Hall Of Fame (Cover of The Script feat. will.i.am)》/ Glee Cast</span></p>]]></description>
