  <item>
    <title>Vol.22 三大东方占卜术，零基础速成！随时随地空手起卦！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/691f2fb7cbba038b4286964b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">691f2fb7cbba038b4286964b</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 20 Nov 2025 15:15:37 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>生活中常常有很多的迷茫时刻，寻人寻物、事之成败、出行旅途、健康疾病、病势缓急、感情姻缘、合散远近等等等等。如果现实利弊已经无法权衡，不如来上一卦，浅看吉凶。</span></p><p><span>本期介绍了三种东方占卜术的用法，希望大家在抉择面前，永远选对。</span></p><p></p><p><span>祝，收听愉快。</span></p><p></p><p><span>—————————</span></p><p><span>以下是本期要点：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="36">00:36</a> 三种占卜术，哪种是你的</span><strong><span>天命技</span></strong><span>？</span></p><p><span>- 宿命感延续：从“宿命”聊到“预测”</span></p><p><span>- 东方玄学三大占卜术：</span><strong><span>小六壬</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>六爻</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>奇门遁甲</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="222">03:42</a> 小六壬</span><strong><span>入门</span></strong><span>：掐指一算，</span><strong><span>速断吉凶</span></strong></p><p><span>- 什么是小六壬？别名、历史、能看啥</span></p><p><span>- 手掌定位教学：</span><strong><span>六个宫位</span></strong><span>对应什么？</span></p><p><span>- </span><strong><span>实战</span></strong><span>演示：时间起盘法（月日时三步走）</span></p><p><span>- 六个宫位</span><strong><span>详解</span></strong><span>：大安、留恋、速喜、赤口、小吉、空亡</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2866">47:46</a> 小六壬</span><strong><span>进阶</span></strong><span>：六亲六神五星，细节拉满！</span></p><p><span>- 完整起盘流程：</span><strong><span>地支</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>六亲</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>六神</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>五星</span></strong></p><p><span>- 如何看细节？比如“相亲能不能成”</span></p><p><span>- 外卦神技：奶奶的“马前外卦”绝活</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3670">1:01:10</a> 普通人占卜：废蓝还是废血？</span></p><p><span>- 占卜会消耗</span><strong><span>灵力</span></strong><span>？真的</span><strong><span>折寿</span></strong><span>？</span></p><p><span>- 如何正确使用占卜？别让它主宰你的人生</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4020">1:07:00</a></span><strong><span>六爻</span></strong><span>篇：一卦看尽事态发展</span></p><p><span>- 六爻 vs 小六壬：像电影 vs 电影简介</span></p><p><span>- 核心逻辑：</span><strong><span>用神</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>动爻</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>变卦</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>应期</span></strong></p><p><span>- 晴天学习心德汇报</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4268">1:11:08</a> 如何挑选靠谱卦师？</span></p><p><span>- 为什么你算的不准？</span><strong><span>专注力</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>责任心</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>三观</span></strong><span>匹配</span></p><p><span>- 命理师的三观如何影响预测结果</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4549">1:15:49</a> 奇门遁甲：高手的玄学布局</span></p><p><span>- 什么是奇门？</span><strong><span>十个奇门九个疯</span></strong><span>？</span></p><p><span>- 六维预测术：天时地利人和 + 神助</span></p><p><span>- 命理奇门 vs 法术奇门：</span><strong><span>运筹</span></strong><span>帷幄 vs </span><strong><span>符咒</span></strong><span>法术</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5067">1:24:27</a> 彩蛋or预告</span></p><p><span>- 年底</span><strong><span>年运</span></strong><span>预约、</span><strong><span>太岁归还</span></strong><span>提醒</span></p><p><span>- 下期预告：年运 or 十神官杀</span></p><p></p><p></p><p><span>—————————</span></p><p><span>以下是本期基础知识要点：</span></p><p><span>掌位图：</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu8JXucTkmFAeDOTvQoZPjd4NQBb.jpg"></figure><p><span>六宫意象：</span></p><p><strong><span>大安​​：</span></strong><span>主吉，代表稳定、安全、顺利。适合求职、出行、求财，预示着事情会朝着好的方向发展。</span></p><p><strong><span>留连​​：</span></strong><span>主拖延、纠缠，事情可能会受阻或反复，不适合做重大决定，比如投资或合作谈判。</span></p><p><strong><span>速喜​​：</span></strong><span>主快速、喜庆，好事来得快，适合寻找失物或等待消息，预示着会有意外的好运。</span></p><p><strong><span>赤口​​：</span></strong><span>主口舌是非、惊险，容易发生争执或意外，不适合处理人际关系或重要事务，尤其要小心钱财方面的问题。</span></p><p><strong><span>小吉​​：</span></strong><span>主吉利、和合，事情会比较顺利，适合处理人际关系或开始新的项目，但可能需要一些时间才能看到成果。</span></p><p><strong><span>空亡​​：</span></strong><span>主凶，代表虚无、无果，事情可能会落空或失败，比如占卜感情可能无果，占卜项目可能夭折，此时宜及时止损。</span></p><p></p><p><span>—————————</span></p><p><span>十二地支与十二时辰：</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrdHGTCKipnAaTXORo4jlF_IUOUf.jpg"></figure><p></p><p><span>—————————</span></p><p><span>六亲：</span></p><p><span>生我者父母：占贵人</span></p><p><span>我生者子孙：占疾病</span></p><p><span>克我者官鬼：占官司、小人、事业</span></p><p><span>我克者妻财：占婚姻、财富、债务</span></p><p><span>同我者兄弟：合作、朋友</span></p><p></p><p><span>—————————</span></p><p><span>六神：</span></p><p><span>青龙：属木，绿色，主文凭、文书、财帛、贵人、酒色</span></p><p><span>朱雀：属火，红色，主口舌、官司、诉讼、信件、热情</span></p><p><span>腾蛇：属土，黄色，主鬼神、弯曲、孤寡、狡诈、纠缠</span></p><p><span>白虎：属金，白色，主伤灾、伤病、横祸、算计、凶狠</span></p><p><span>玄武：属水，蓝色，主暧昧、私情、盗窃、小人、流动</span></p><p></p><p><span>—————————</span></p><p><span>对我们感兴趣的伙伴，欢迎加入听友群💗</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/liIFTqHwZq53iT0gjwaJ4Cp4_eCQ.PNG"><p><span>—————————</span></p><p><span>&lt;相关单集&gt;</span></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/68fb9144083a71a4eb1cb694" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/68fb9144083a71a4eb1cb694"><span>Vol.21 坦白局：有些命运真的逃不掉！</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/67e75f836ea60022357d64fd" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/67e75f836ea60022357d64fd"><span>Vol. 12 五行喜忌基础局：易学小白也可以成为自己的命理师！</span></a></p><p></p><p><span>—————————</span></p><p><span>&lt;关于本期BGM&gt;</span></p><p><span>开头：《千面》/ 裁缝铺</span></p><p><span>结尾：《三净咒》/ 南青乐队</span></p>]]></description>
