  <item>
    <title>Vol.21 坦白局：有些命运真的逃不掉！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68fb9144083a71a4eb1cb694</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68fb9144083a71a4eb1cb694</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 24 Oct 2025 14:50:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你感受过“命运的推背感”吗？</span></p><p><span>你有没有经历过，万般努力挣扎之后，那些该失去的，该失败的，该错过的，依然没有改变。</span></p><p><span>宿命真的，存在吗？</span></p><p><span>宿命真的，不存在吗？</span></p><p><span>本期我们来聊一聊，生命中，那些神秘莫测，神出鬼没的，宿命。</span></p><p><span>祝，收听愉快。</span></p><p></p><p><span>以下是本期要点：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="177">02:57</a> 聊聊那些“被命运推了一把”的小故事</span></p><p><span>- &nbsp;我命，不由我，不由天？</span></p><p><span> </span><strong><span>悟力</span></strong><span> or</span><strong><span>执念</span></strong></p><p><span>- &nbsp;我命，由天，不由我。</span></p><p><span> 是</span><strong><span>无形的手</span></strong><span>，还是</span><strong><span>薛定谔</span></strong><span>的未来</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1305">21:45</a> 什么样的缘分，是天注定的缘分</span></p><p><span>- &nbsp;</span><strong><span>夫妻宫动</span></strong><span>，冤家路窄 </span></p><p><span>婚运那一年</span><strong><span>如何分辨</span></strong><span>那个对的人</span></p><p><span>- &nbsp;</span><strong><span>错的人</span></strong><span>，走不到最后，为什么还会遇见</span></p><p><strong><span>因果债</span></strong><span>or</span><strong><span>业力缘分</span></strong></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1813">30:13</a> 命运在出手之前，其实是有</span><strong><span>暗示</span></strong><span>的</span></p><p><span>- &nbsp;那些</span><strong><span>反常</span></strong><span>，巧合，与阴差阳错</span></p><p><span>- &nbsp;</span><strong><span>显化</span></strong><span>，和命运互相洗脑</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2366">39:26</a> </span><strong><span>梦境</span></strong><span>真的能预示</span><strong><span>吉凶</span></strong><span>吗？</span></p><p><span>- &nbsp;感应梦，理所应当</span></p><p><span>- &nbsp;预知梦，自有分辨</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2735">45:35</a> 人，真的终究逃不过宿命吗？</span></p><p><span>- &nbsp;</span><strong><span>宿命</span></strong><span>也分</span><strong><span>大小</span></strong><span>？</span></p><p><span>- &nbsp;不必逃，正面刚</span></p><p></p><p></p><p><span>对我们感兴趣的伙伴，欢迎加入听友群💗</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/liIFTqHwZq53iT0gjwaJ4Cp4_eCQ.PNG"><p><span>&lt;相关单集&gt;</span></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/67912e87a2c8d144a7deb364" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/67912e87a2c8d144a7deb364"><span>Vol. 03 "正缘“请听好（上）：桃花在何方？是何人？何时到？</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/679b7340d74435e4a36a7477" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/679b7340d74435e4a36a7477"><span>Vol. 04 "正缘“请听好（下）：玄学视角下“ta”是不是你的命中注定？</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/686b6ca893fd2d72b8eb3432" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/686b6ca893fd2d72b8eb3432"><span>Vol.15 聊聊大运，你的电子命理师带你逃离低谷期</span></a></p><p></p><p><span>&lt;关于本期BGM&gt;</span></p><p><span>开头：《Reality》/ Richard Sanderson</span></p><p><span>结尾：《今天等我来》/ 陈奕迅</span></p>]]></description>
