  <item>
    <title>Vol.19 神煞详解：大师我命带“煞星&amp;福星”吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68cae77ba56ca3e0c4f65409</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68cae77ba56ca3e0c4f65409</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 17 Sep 2025 17:11:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>神煞，实为命理系统中一类独特的“象语”，喻示人生不同层面的能量倾向与事件意象。吉者如贵人扶助，凶者如逆风险阻，皆是对命运趋势的一种隐喻。</span></p><p><span>本期节目将对神煞系统进行脉络上的梳理，助你知命而不惑，识煞而不惧。</span></p><p><span>祝，收听愉快。</span></p><p><span>本期节目要点：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="186">03:06</a> 神煞究竟是什么？是在我们身边的</span><strong><span>神仙</span></strong><span>和</span><strong><span>煞星</span></strong><span>吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="638">10:38</a> 八字中，相同神煞出现在</span><strong><span>年月日时柱</span></strong><span>上有什么区别？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="884">14:44</a> 相同神煞在八字中出现</span><strong><span>好几次</span></strong><span>是怎么回事？比如有两个孤辰就是</span><strong><span>天煞孤星</span></strong><span>吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1185">19:45</a> 常见</span><strong><span>吉神</span></strong><span>（天乙贵人、天德贵人、月德贵人、三奇贵人、文昌贵人、天厨贵人、文昌贵人、太极贵人、福星贵人、国印贵人、德秀贵人、学堂词馆）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1780">29:40</a> 是不是</span><strong><span>贵人</span></strong><span>越多越幸运？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a> 常见</span><strong><span>凶神</span></strong><span>（阴差阳错、十恶大败、勾绞煞、劫煞、丧门、空亡、亡神、吊客、羊刃、天罗、地网）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2481">41:21</a> 姻缘</span><strong><span>合婚</span></strong><span>（红鸾、天喜、桃花、孤辰、寡宿）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2845">47:25</a> </span><strong><span>其他</span></strong><span>常见神煞（驿马、金舆、华盖、童子煞）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3069">51:09</a> 遇到不好的神煞到底</span><strong><span>能不能解</span></strong><span>，</span><strong><span>能不能破</span></strong><span>？</span></p><p><span>对我们感兴趣的伙伴，欢迎加入听友群💗</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/liIFTqHwZq53iT0gjwaJ4Cp4_eCQ.PNG"><p><span>本期两个小知识点：</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FknpjhOlAiUfr-knHubXzi8__fMR.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjJR0hCWIRCRglTGHndljF9TEsPr.jpg"></figure><p><span>&lt;相关单集&gt;</span></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/686b6ca893fd2d72b8eb3432" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/686b6ca893fd2d72b8eb3432"><span>Vol.15 聊聊大运，你的电子命理师带你逃离低谷期</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/67e75f836ea60022357d64fd" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/67e75f836ea60022357d64fd"><span>Vol. 12 五行喜忌基础局：易学小白也可以成为自己的命理师！</span></a></p><p><span>&lt;关于本期BGM&gt;</span></p><p><span>开头：《活生生的生活 》/五条人</span></p><p><span>结尾：《我的孤独认出你的孤独》/ 陈婧霏</span></p>]]></description>
